        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_37da9f96dc904d259142c9b8c2cab7af",
      "statement": "Condominium claims require separate handling of individual unit property, common or limited common elements, association property, shared systems, personal property, liability damage, and assessments, with separate scopes, records, payment authority, and inspection access for each interest.",
