      "statement": "Water claims, including condominium water claims, require source-and-path investigation before a coverage position; the file must distinguish failed-part damage from resulting damage and distinguish plumbing discharge, repeated leakage, surface water, sewer or drain backup, sump conditions, roof opening, and outside water entry while preserving source evidence.",
