      "statement": "The current HO-3 2024-03 base form provides up to $2,000 when an assessment is made against an owner or tenant for direct physical loss to property owned collectively by association members and caused by a covered cause of loss; Section I deductible rules apply to covered loss unless modified by the issued policy or an endorsement.",
